@startuml
title Tabel Referensi - Autentikasi User (Jejak Rimba)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

note as T1
**Tabel Jenis Autentikasi**
|===
| Metode | Deskripsi | Role Dukungan
| Email + Password | Registrasi & login standar | Penyewa, Vendor
| Google OAuth | Login via akun Google | Penyewa, Vendor
| Reset Password | Kirim email reset ke user | Penyewa, Vendor
|===
end note

note as T2
**Tabel Flow Registrasi per Role**
|===
| Role | Tabel yang DiIsi | Data Tambahan
| Penyewa | auth.users, profiles | full_name, phone_number
| Vendor | auth.users, profiles, vendors | business_name, whatsapp, address, lat/long
|===
end note

note as T3
**Tabel Decision Points**
|===
| Decision Point | Guard True | Guard False
| Memiliki Akun? | [Tidak] → flow daftar | [Ya] → flow login
| Data Valid? | [Ya] → buat akun | [Tidak] → error
| Role Vendor? | [Ya] → simpan data usaha | [Penyewa] → skip
| Kredensial Benar? | [Ya] → buat sesi | [Tidak] → error login
| Login Google? | [Ya] → redirect OAuth | [Tidak] → lanjut
| Ingin Keluar? | [Ya] → hapus sesi | [Tidak] → lanjut app
|===
end note

note as T4
**Tabel Entitas Data**
|===
| Entitas | Field Penting
| auth.users | id, email, encrypted_password, email_confirmed_at
| profiles | id, full_name, phone_number, role, avatar_url
| vendors | id, profile_id, business_name, whatsapp_number, address, is_active
|===
end note

@enduml